WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.030
“I’m going to miss you so much, Poppy,” said the tall, thin teenager.
“我会非常想你的，波比。”这个又高又瘦的少年说。

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:08.070
He bent down to hug his old friend goodbye.
他弯下腰，抱了抱他的老朋友，跟它道别。

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:14.110
He stood up, hugged his parents, and smiled, trying not to let his emotions get the better of him.
他站起身，拥抱了父母，笑了笑，努力不让情绪失控。

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:18.080
His parents were not quite able to keep theirs under control.
他的父母却没能完全控制住自己的情绪。

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:24.710
They had driven their son several hours out of town to the university where he would soon be living and studying.
他们开了几个小时的车，把儿子送到城外的大学，不久他就要在那里生活和学习了。

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:28.960
It was time to say goodbye—for now, at least.
是时候说再见了——至少是暂时的。

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.880
The family hugged and smiled through misty eyes and then laughed.
一家人拥抱在一起，含着泪微笑，接着又笑出了声。

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.760
The boy lifted the last bag onto his shoulder, and flashed a bright smile.
男孩把最后一个包扛上肩膀，露出灿烂的笑容。

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.020
“I guess this is it,” he said.
“我想就到这儿了。”他说。

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.200
“I’ll see you back home in a month, okay?”
“一个月后家里见，好吗？”

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.970
His parents nodded, and they watched as he walked out of sight into the crowds of hundreds of students and parents.
父母点了点头，看着他走进成百上千的学生和家长人群中，直到看不见他的身影。

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:55.620
The boy’s mother turned to the dog and said, “Okay, Poppy, time to go back home.”
男孩的妈妈转向小狗说：“好了，波比，该回家了。”

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:59.610
The house seemed quiet as a tomb without the boy living there.
男孩不在家住了，屋里安静得像坟墓一样。

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:06.740
All that week, Poppy didn’t seem interested in her dinner, her favorite toy, or even in her daily walk.
那一整周，波比对晚饭、最喜欢的玩具，甚至每天的散步，似乎都提不起兴趣。

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:11.570
Her owners were sad too, but they knew their son would be back to visit.
它的主人也很难过，可他们知道儿子会回来看看的。

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:13.270
Poppy didn’t.
波比却不知道。

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:17.260
They offered the dog some of her favorite peanut butter treats.
他们给小狗喂它最爱吃的花生酱零食。

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:23.270
They even let her sit on the sofa, but the old girl just wasn’t her usual cheerful self.
他们甚至让它坐到沙发上，可这只老狗就是没有平时那样快活。

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:25.750
Her owners started to get worried.
主人开始担心起来。

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:28.980
“What should we do to cheer Poppy up?” asked Dad.
“我们该怎么做才能让波比高兴起来呢？”爸爸问。

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:31.040
“We’ve tried everything.”
“能试的我们都试过了。”

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:35.230
“I have an idea, but it might be a little crazy,” smiled Mom.
“我有个主意，不过可能有点疯狂。”妈妈笑着说。

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:40.160
“Without anybody left in the house but us, this place could use a bit of fun.
“家里除了我们俩，一个人都没剩下，这地方真该添点乐趣了。

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:42.700
Let’s get a little dog for Poppy.”
咱们给波比找只小狗吧。”

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:47.290
It didn’t take long before they walked through the front door carrying a big box.
没过多久，他们就抱着一个大箱子走进了前门。

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:52.500
Poppy welcomed them home as usual but when she saw the box, she stopped.
波比像往常一样欢迎他们回家，可一看到箱子，它就停住了。

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.550
She put her nose on it.
它把鼻子凑到箱子上。

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:59.670
Her tail began wagging ever so slowly, then faster as she caught the smell.
它的尾巴开始极慢地摆动，等闻到气味后，摆得越来越快。

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:03.140
Dad opened the box and a sweet little dog appeared.
爸爸打开箱子，一只可爱的小狗出现了。

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:07.400
A few weeks later, the boy arrived home from university.
几个星期后，男孩从大学回到了家。
